                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "If you are craving authentic Malaysian food, you must visit Mr. Chee (Shilin Branch)! They hold a Halal-friendly certificate and use only Halal-certified meat sources, so you can dine with peace of mind. The location is very strategic, situated right near Zhishan Station. Their laksa soup is incredibly delicious, and you can really taste that all the condiments are freshly made. It is a highly recommended spot for any Muslim friend looking for a great meal in the area.",
